<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, falls on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, falls on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling on Thursday appreciated against the dollar and slipped for a third day against the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 593.8218 to the dollar compared to Wednesday's 594.1287 while the pound exchanged at 998.0987 compared to 996.6821.</p>
